Describe the goal of the project.
Investigating the player characteristic with the highest impact on the probability of a higher ranked player winning a tournament.

Describe the data set used in the project. What are the observations in the data? What is the source of the data? How were the data originally collected?
The dataset used was from 2023, and collected by the Women's Tennis Association from the International Tennis Federation. The observations (each describe 1 match) include player attributes (player heights, player ages, player handedness), set scores, and floor surface type. The outcome variable is the outcome of the match (a bit unclear which variable that is).

